X        +----+-------------------------------------+----+  |
X        |    |          top margin 2 (m2)          |    |  |
X        +----+-------------------------------------+----+  |
X        |    |                  .                  |    |  P
X        |    |<-- indent (.in)  .                  |    |  A
X        |    |                  .                  |    |  G
X        |    |                  T                  |    |  E
X        |    |                  E                  |    |
X        |    |                  X                  |    |  L
X        |    |                  T                  |    |  E
