X        +----+-------------------------------------+----+  |
X        |    |          bottom margin 3 (m3)       |    |  |
X        +----+-------------------------------------+----+  |
X        |    |  bottom margin (m4) includes footer |    |  |
X        +----+-------------------------------------+----+ -+
X        |                                               |
